1. Maximum Sum Subarray (Kadane's Algorithm)
Question

Find the maximum sum of a contiguous subarray.

n = int(input())
arr = list(map(int, input().split()))

curr = ans = arr[0]

for i in range(1, n):
    curr = max(arr[i], curr + arr[i])
    ans = max(ans, curr)

print(ans)
